Togl vendor baseline
====================

Source: Tcl3D 1.0.2 source distribution
URL: https://www.tcl3d.org/download/distributions/tcl3d-1.0.2.7z
Imported: 2026-07-09

This directory contains the enhanced Togl implementation from Tcl3D's
`tcl3dOgl/Togl` directory.  The original Togl license is in `LICENSE`; Tcl3D's
license is in `Tcl3D_License.txt`.

BRL-CAD changes:

* Rename the package initializer and widget constructor to the private
  `BrlcadTkObolHost` / `::brlcad::tkobol::host` names.
* Remove Tcl3D build metadata registration.
* Remove the GLEW dependency.  The host uses platform OpenGL declarations and
  loads optional context-creation entry points through GLX/WGL directly.
* Build the host as an implementation detail of libtclcad's Tk Obol support.
* Preserve the legacy WGL DM's delayed top-level deiconify sequencing after
  Tk creates and maps the native window.
* Resolve warnings diagnosed by BRL-CAD's strict compiler settings without
  changing widget behavior.

Keep local changes small and auditable so a future Tcl3D update can be rebased
against this baseline.
